<title>INDIA: INDIA 270-5 AT CLOSE ON THIRD DAY V SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>INDIA 270-5 AT CLOSE ON THIRD DAY V SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>KANPUR, India 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 270 for five in their second innings at close of play, an overall lead of 330, on the third day of the third and final cricket test against South Africa on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 237 and 270-5 (Mohammed Azharuddin 88 not out), South Africa 177.</p>
